  "prompt": "The function\n[Figure 1]\nis defined by\n[Figure 2]\n, where\n[Figure 3]\nand\n[Figure 4]\nare constants. The graph of\n[Figure 5]\nin the xy-plane has its vertex at\n[Figure 6]\nand passes through the point\n[Figure 7]\n. What is the value of\n[Figure 8]\n?",
